  "discordPostHtml": "<p><strong>Adds Delta AI Cores!</strong></p><p>Do you WANT to do an automated ship only playthrough?<br>Do you HATE the automated ship penalty?<br>The Delta Core is here to help!</p><p>Download: <a href=\"https://github.com/ymfah/Delata-Cores/releases/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/ymfah/Delata-Cores/releases/</a><br>Forum Thread: <a href=\"https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=30126.0\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=30126.0</a></p><p>These cluster of Delta level AI cores have no skills   , no value<br>But will contribute a whooping <strong>0x</strong> to the automated ship multiplier!<br>You can find these at any place where AI cores usually drop (stations, probes, etc)<br>Delta level AIs are not illegal by domain law, and are completely legal! (church and path might say otherwise)</p><pre><code>Can be safely added but not removed from existing games.</code></pre><p>Credit : arthr for the amazing icon and portrait!</p>",
